1. OBJECTIVE
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Build a minimal webview-bootstrap APK with python-for-android (p4a) wrapping the
existing Flask app (src/ unmodified), install it on Waydroid, and capture
on-device proof that the Flask/Jinja UI renders.

